meta {
  name: 05 modes
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  The two things this artifact can be. `server` is the default and is what the
  preview's Deployment runs; `db-init` is the one-shot path the chart runs as a
  hook-scoped Job before the rollout.

  db-init has no HTTP surface, so it is proven here by its OBSERVABLE OUTCOME
  through the serving process: the schema its migration created, and the preset
  row its idempotent seed wrote.
}
